cff-version: 1.2.0
title: DataGenX
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software and the
  accompanying TPCTC paper.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ramanavarapu
    given-names: Sreeharsha
repository-code: "https://github.com/sreeharshar84/datagenx-mono"
abstract: >-
  Generates synthetic database data matching the statistical properties of a
  source schema -- histograms, distinct counts, cardinality -- without reading
  or reproducing any source values, so query optimization strategies can be
  evaluated against realistic statistics on data that carries no proprietary
  content.
keywords:
  - synthetic data generation
  - query optimization
  - database benchmarking
  - TPC-H
  - TPC-DS
license: MIT

# TODO before publishing: complete the author list, and add the DOI and
